00:13:57.290 --> 00:14:00.450
I can stitch up my own injuries.

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:03.740
Women or children,
I kill all the shits in my way.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.370
Such a rotten mouth.

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:07.200
Did anyone hear what I said?

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:10.290
This will vaporize a human--

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.290
Come at me all at once!

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:11.990
I'll take everyone down!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:14.790
Are you even listening?!

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:14.790
I've got you!

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:22.830
Be careful! Akudama are attacking
this place and it's super dangerous now!

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:23.950
Uh...

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:29.240
Huh?

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:30.790
Who's that?

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:32.660
Who is it this time?

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.700
She's not on the Akudama list.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:36.870
So, an ordinary person?

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:40.040
I was trying to catch this cat, and...

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.370
<i>Takoyaki</i> guy?

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:45.080
Oh? Is this your cute girlfriend, Courier?

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:47.160
You let your girl tag along?!

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:49.870
Courier... Akudama...?

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:51.450
She's nobody.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.410
All right. Let's kill her then.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.160
Huh?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:59.910
After all, the fewer, the better.

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:03.040
I haven't dissected a youngster in ages.

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:11.740
I...

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:13.370
Swindler

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.490
I...

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.950
I'm Swindler.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:21.950
Swindler?

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:28.370
Th-That's right! I-I'm not on the Akudama list
because I managed to trick it!

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:29.870
Seriously? Awesome!

00:15:29.870 --> 00:15:32.410
That shouldn't even be possible!

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:37.450
I see. That means you're one of
our rivals here for Cutthroat, too.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:38.080
Huh?!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.740
Duke it out with me!

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:42.330
A better hacker than me? Interesting.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.540
What? No! That's not what I--

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:45.330
Wait.

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:47.040
What now?

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:48.740
Did anyone call the elevator?

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:51.040
I didn't do anything.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.910
No way! My hacking was overridden!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.910
Override

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:02.660
A tank?!

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:02.660
Woo!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.790
--Fun at last!
--That's a problem.

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.700
<i>Kansai Police Station
<i></i></i>Underground Prison

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.700
<i>Kansai Police Station
<i></i></i>Underground Prison

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.580
Does nothing faze you?!

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:22.660
At this point, 100 million doesn't quite cut it!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.410
Find your own ride.

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:32.290
I heard something about 100 million!

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:35.200
I've gotta good feeling about this!

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:41.080
"Hoodlum"
"Sentenced - 4 years"

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:44.040
Let me in on the action!

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:52.080
"Today"
"Cutthroat Public Execution"

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:46.690
"Estimated Sentence - 967 years"

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:50.240
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:52.080
<i>Kansai Police Station
Execution Hall</i>

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:52.080
<i>Kansai Police Station
<i>Execution Hall</i></i>

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:54.490
"Estimated Sentence - 967 years"

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:57.330
In moments, we will execute
the deadliest cutthroat in history!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:02.910
This will be a day of incredible pride
for the Kansai Police!

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:07.580
Now, begin the countdown!

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:13.700
Ten! Nine! Eight! Seven! Six!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:18.870
Five! Four! Three! Two!

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:21.910
What the--?!

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:27.620
Huh?!

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:38.120
Hell yeah! I can go all out
and it comes back for more!

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:38.120
Get off, wench.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.790
This can't be good.

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:42.290
This is...!

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.450
Oh?

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.870
Gah! Is this why it's 100 mil?!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:57.330
Who the heck are you?!

00:17:57.330 --> 00:18:02.910
I'm just a measly hoodlum serving
four years! I don't wanna die!

00:18:02.910 --> 00:18:05.290
What are you doing?! Drop the guillotine!

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:07.040
I-In this craziness?!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:10.870
You idiot! The Akudama are
here to rescue Cutthroat!

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:13.240
Correct.

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:15.660
I'll be taking Cutthroat now.

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:16.620
Akudama!

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:20.950
Trying to beat me to the punch?
Cutthroat is mine.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:24.490
In your dreams! Killing Cutthroat will be our--

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:29.040
Hey! Stay out of my way!

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:39.200
Is he insane?!

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.740
Scary! This is scary, lady!

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:49.200
You're an Akudama! Get a hold of yourself!

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:37.200
I'm sorry!

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:47.120
I've gotta return his money...

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:51.040
Over here!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:51.790
What?

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:55.330
Here! Here! There's Akudama over here, too!

00:19:52.490 --> 00:19:55.330
What are you doing?!

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.120
Holy smokes!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:00.510
Detained
Minor Offender

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:00.590
Sentenced - 4 Years
D-Rank Akudama

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:01.670
Detained
Minor Offender

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:01.670
Sentenced - 4 Years
D-Rank Akudama

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:04.290
Run away!

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:18.660
Perfect.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:32.080
I won't thank you.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.490
Yeah... That's fine.

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:36.620
Gah! It's over already?

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:38.990
Nothing's more boring than a brawl.

00:20:38.990 --> 00:20:41.200
Cutthroat isn't dead yet, right?

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:43.370
You damn Akudama!

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:47.410
You'll never get Cutthroat!
I'm gonna make sure they're executed...

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:50.080
...and exterminate the rest of you trash!

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:52.870
Serves you right! You're the scum of society!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:57.120
If you caught me...

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:02.660
...you really should have killed me.

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.910
"Cutthroat"
"Estimated Sentence - 967 years"

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:13.620
So that's Cutthroat?

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.740
What about the reward?

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:17.740
For you.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:20.290
Awesome! Just like they said!

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:22.120
Hey, hey! What's the deal?

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:24.410
Courier had a different job?

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:26.870
Hey, what's going on here?

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:31.040
--Huh? What?
--The hell's this?

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:32.490
A bomb!

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:33.830
Why do I have one?!

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:35.580
I could just yank it off.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:40.540
Shit! Shit! Why do I have one?! Take it off!

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:44.240
Ooh! It's a fountain of red!

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:45.200
I see...

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.120
Hey! Explain yourself!

00:21:47.120 --> 00:21:48.910
I don't know anything either.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:52.950
You've gotta help me! I'm just an ordinary--

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:55.330
Huh?

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:58.700
What?

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:01.790
It looks like everyone's here.

00:23:44.830 --> 00:23:47.080
Now then, it's time to clean up.
